# Mini Marketplace — environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local development (`.env` is git-ignored). Never put real secrets here:
# this file holds safe placeholders only.
#
# No variables are required yet. Each variable is added together with the code that reads it
# (through the typed config service) and documented in this file, e.g.:
#   DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL, JWT_ACCESS_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_SECRET, ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD
